{"id":"en_forced-into-an-abortion-her-revenge-begins","title":"Forced Into an Abortion, Her Revenge Begins","titleEn":"Forced Into an Abortion, Her Revenge Begins","description":"After marrying Klaus, Grace stepped away from the business world entirely, leaving the company in his hands and avoiding public events so completely that the press had no photographs of her. When a shareholders’ meeting brought her back, she greeted Klaus warmly, but his secretary, Mia, mistook her for a mistress pursuing her boss. The situation worsened once Mia learned Grace was pregnant, and she went as far as attempting to force Grace into an abortion. Falsely accused of abuse, Grace must now decide how to take revenge on the secretary who wronged her.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/forced-into-an-abortion-her-revenge-begins/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/forced-into-an-abortion-her-revenge-begins/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7divn2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_forced-into-an-abortion-her-revenge-begins_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7divn2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_forced-into-an-abortion-her-revenge-begins_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7divn2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_forced-into-an-abortion-her-revenge-begins_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7divn2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_forced-into-an-abortion-her-